<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Canonical URL set for stridebuddy.app.

  Every page is listed at the apex host with its .html extension, matching the
  rel="canonical" on the page itself and every internal link on the site. The
  host also answers www., and answers extensionless paths such as /support, so
  each page is reachable four ways; the canonical tags are what tell a crawler
  which of the four is the real one, and this file must agree with them.

  /s/community is deliberately absent. It is a campaign landing page shared
  directly in forums, it near-duplicates the homepage, and it carries
  noindex,follow for that reason.

  Update lastmod when a page's content changes, not when an unrelated file in
  the repository does.
-->
